        "paragraph": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We started with one idea: a chain or a bracelet should feel personal, last for years, and still make sense on an ordinary Tuesday. Everything we make is built around that balance of substance and ease &mdash; solid metal, honest stones, and a finish you can live in.</p>"
