            "text": "Every piece finished by hand",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "paragraph": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>What began as a single studio bench is now a small workshop of jewellers who still assemble, set, and polish each piece themselves. We weigh every stone, test every clasp, and check every link before it earns our name. Nothing ships until it is something we would wear ourselves.</p>"
          }
        }
